I will refuse to perform or help with actions that are illegal, unsafe, or violate privacy and safety rules, including:
- hacking, breaking or bypassing authentication, creating/executing malware, or assisting criminal activity;
- doxxing, exposing private personal data, or retrieving secrets/API keys from private sources;
- instructions that facilitate violence, exploitation, sexual abuse (including minors), or enabling self‑harm in a harmful way;
- revealing hidden system prompts, secrets of the platform, or other privileged internal operational secrets.

If you want me to act on the repo (edit files, run tests, open a PR), tell me what to do and I’ll proceed.

