Indexing / storage suggestions (compact)
- Index timestamp, request_id, raw_message_hash, model_version, policy_decision.decision, extracted_intent, and client_metadata.ip_hash.
- Keep raw_message out of primary store unless policy allows; use raw_message_hash for correlation.
- Retention: keep full records for the configured retention_days; surface alerts/aggregates longer-term.

