Notes for applying the template
- PUT the above JSON to the cluster (staging) at the index template endpoint. For modern Elasticsearch:
  PUT /_index_template/assistant_actions_template
  with body = mapping_template.json
- For older clusters you may PUT /_template/assistant_actions_template; adapt to your cluster version.
