Run (example)
- Install dependency:
  - pip install jsonschema
- Run against the sample mocked responses:
  - python test_harness_strict.py --responses sample_responses.json --expected expected_responses.json
  - or using the mock generator:
  - python test_harness_strict.py --mock --expected expected_responses.json

Notes
- The harness will perform full schema validation of each log_entry. The sample_responses.json is constructed to validate against the embedded schema and expected_responses.json.
- Do not run this against production logs containing unredacted secrets. Use staging/test data only.

